> 
> Oh yeah, what's this infinite carrying capacity trick you can do with a
> bag of holding? That could be really useful.

You need a cursed bag of holding.  Load it up with lots of junk you don't need,
and then #apply it a bunch of times.  The items in the bag will start
disappearing, and the bag will have a negative weight, because of some bug in
the game.  The negative weight makes you able to carry more stuff...

